#: ../../11-observability.md:34 d5858cb9e99546d7a0b320259646a395
msgid "11. Observability"
msgstr "11. 可观测性"

#: ../../11-observability.md:38 5b9a6a967e4544bdaea889e1147ed812
msgid ""
"The primary signal for OpenResty is the Nginx error log plus `ngx.log` lines"
" from Lua; the runtime ships no per-request metrics by default. This page "
"documents what to log, how to correlate, and which counters to build - with "
"the DNS-failure signals as the worked example (verified against nginx 1.31.1"
" / ngx_lua 0.10.31rc5 in this tree)."
msgstr ""
"OpenResty 的主要信号是 Nginx 错误日志加上来自 Lua 的 `ngx.log` "
"行；运行时默认不提供按请求的指标。本页说明要记录什么、如何关联，以及要构建哪些计数器——并以 DNS 失败信号作为完整示例（已对照本源码树中的 "
"nginx 1.31.1 / ngx_lua 0.10.31rc5 核实）。"

